{"abstract":[{"text":"Install the bundled ","type":"text"},{"code":"swidux-ref","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" skill so your AI coding assistant has Swidux’s architecture rules and code templates on hand.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/AgentSkill"},"sections":[],"kind":"article","metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Using the Swidux Agent Skill","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill files live in this repo at ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SKILL.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-patterns.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppState"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppAction"},{"type":"text","text":", reducers, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStore"},{"type":"text","text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Installing-the-skill","level":2,"text":"Installing the skill","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Claude Code does ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inli